#: pdf-forms-for-contact-form-7.php:2473
msgid "PDF Forms Filler for CF7"
msgstr "CF7 的 PDF 表单填写器"

#. Plugin URI of the plugin
#: pdf-forms-for-contact-form-7.php:4
